<div class="maq-page-shell" style="padding-top:0;">
    <div class="maq-section-card">
        <h5 class='zcs-font-20 zcs-font-semibold zcs-color-primary zcs-m-0 zcs-mb-8'>Review guidance</h5>
        <div class='zcs-w-full zcs-flex zcs-direction-column zcs-gap-16'>
            <div class='zcs-toast zcs-success-toast zcs-w-full zcs-flex zcs-gap-8 zcs-px-16 zcs-py-12 zcs-rounded-sm zcs-box-border zcs-font-14 zcs-font-normal zcs-lh-body zcs-color-primary'>
                <i class='zcs-toast-icon zcs-no-shrink zcs-lh-body zc-li-outline ui-1-check-circle-08'></i>
                <div class='zcs-toast-text'><p class='zcs-m-0'><strong>Green:</strong> no critical or warning compliance findings. Review claim context, then use the report action to clear or approve.</p></div>
            </div>
            <div class='zcs-toast zcs-warning-toast zcs-w-full zcs-flex zcs-gap-8 zcs-px-16 zcs-py-12 zcs-rounded-sm zcs-box-border zcs-font-14 zcs-font-normal zcs-lh-body zcs-color-primary'>
                <i class='zcs-toast-icon zcs-no-shrink zcs-lh-body zc-li-outline ui-1-notification-69'></i>
                <div class='zcs-toast-text'><p class='zcs-m-0'><strong>Yellow:</strong> warning-only findings. Use Approve With Warnings only when the warning rationale is acceptable and no unresolved critical violation remains.</p></div>
            </div>
            <div class='zcs-toast zcs-error-toast zcs-w-full zcs-flex zcs-gap-8 zcs-px-16 zcs-py-12 zcs-rounded-sm zcs-box-border zcs-font-14 zcs-font-normal zcs-lh-body zcs-color-primary'>
                <i class='zcs-toast-icon zcs-no-shrink zcs-lh-body zc-li-outline ui-3-alert'></i>
                <div class='zcs-toast-text'><p class='zcs-m-0'><strong>Red:</strong> critical compliance failures or exception blockers. Recheck compliance, wait for exception approval, return to claimant, or reject through the report workflow.</p></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class='zcs-notes-wrapper zcs-mt-16'>
            <p class='zcs-notes-text zcs-m-0 zcs-font-14 zcs-font-normal zcs-lh-body zcs-color-primary'>
                <span class='zcs-notes-title zcs-font-medium zcs-color-tertiary'>Note: </span>
                Keep action execution in the Pending Manager Approval report. This page is a review surface and does not perform SAP updates or write-back.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>